WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.172
The assessment has two parts.

00:00:02.172 --> 00:00:08.217
First, create the employee and department information view in the analytics schema.

00:00:08.217 --> 00:00:13.662
The view should include employee name, salary, and department name.

00:00:13.662 --> 00:00:20.152
Second, use only that view to calculate the average salary for the Sales department.

00:00:20.152 --> 00:00:24.177
The important part is not only getting the syntax right.

00:00:24.177 --> 00:00:32.040
You should also be able to say that one row in the view represents one employee, and explain why the view is reusable.
